@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam componentStyle uml2
actor Client
component "HTTP API" as API
component "Serialized node owner" as Node
component "Deterministic Raft core" as Core
component "Peer transport + timers" as IO
database "Durable state\nterm, vote, log, commit, identity" as Disk
component "Other configured nodes" as Peers
Client --> API : commands / status
API --> Node : serialized input
Node --> Core : message / timeout / proposal
Node --> Disk : persist before effects [R7]
Node --> IO : release durable outbound effects
IO --> Peers : RequestVote / AppendEntries
Peers --> API : peer RPCs
IO --> Node : correlated reply / timer
note bottom of Node
One owner; never await network while holding it.
Disk failure fences the node.
end note
@enduml
